                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1][b][i]Not a Bad Platform Game[/i][/b][/h1]\n\n[b]Sup all ! I Like this little platform game! Its kinda like a old school one from old console days ! The mechanics are pretty neat you throw your arm and you can hit things and use it as a weapon and like a magnet it comes back and you also can throw it and jump and goto the arm to reach higher places or to jump past objects ! The level design isnt that bad and the gfx arent that bad also.The price i think its right on the money for this one ! So give this one a hand up :P  ![/b]\n",
